==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|misaine|lang=frm}}, modified from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|migenne|lang=fro}} (through influence from Italian {{term|mezzana|lang=it}}), from {{etyl|ca|en}} {{term|mitjana|lang=ca}}, feminine of {{term|mitjan|lang=ca}}, ultimately from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|medianus|lang=la}}.

